{'symbol': 'MRO', 'date': '2023-02-15 16:30:00', 'title': 'MARATHON OIL ANNOUNCES 2023 CAPITAL BUDGET AND REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2022 RESULTS', 'text': "RETURNED $3 BILLION OF CAPITAL TO SHAREHOLDERS IN 2022 HOUSTON , FEB. 15, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MARATHON OIL CORPORATION (NYSE: MRO) REPORTED FULL YEAR 2022 NET INCOME OF $3,612 MILLION, OR $5.26 PER DILUTED SHARE, WHICH INCLUDES THE IMPACT OF CERTAIN ITEMS NOT TYPICALLY REPRESENTED IN ANALYSTS' EARNINGS ESTIMATES AND THAT WOULD OTHERWISE AFFECT COMPARABILITY OF RESULTS. ADJUSTED NET INCOME WAS $3,078 MILLION, OR $4.48 PER DILUTED SHARE."}